  "note": "Pins the upstream files that define and write the reader's series.json. The bridge ports this contract (mokuro_bridge/series_json.py) instead of vendoring GPL-3.0 or MPL-2.0 source, so the pin, not a copy, is what stays current. `mokuro-bridge --check-series-reference` re-fetches and compares; `--refresh-series-reference` re-pins. Tests check the offline half and the parity fixture in tests/fixtures/series_json/.",
  "introduced_in": "mokuro-reader v1.9.0 (commit d1670bfe3d66, 2026-08-18; first release carrying series.json: v1.9.0, 2026-08-29). v1.10.0 does not change the format."
